# Prettier 3 already reads .gitignore, so .next/ and node_modules/ need no line
# here. This file is only for tracked files that should keep their own shape.

# `next dev` rewrites the top of AGENTS.md on every run, and the prose in
# docs/ is wrapped by hand — reflowing it produces a diff on every format with
# nothing in it. Prettier is here for code.
*.md
